{
    "title": "Moto Rider, Bike Racing Game",
    "description": "Ride Hard, Race Harder!\r\nStart the engine, hit the gas and experience the thrill of handling a 200 HP beast with Moto Racing Bike Game. \r\n\r\nREAL MOTO RACING EXPERIENCE\r\n\r\nA motorcycle racing game that keeps you on the track, focuses on bike racing skills and experiences the intense bike racing action.\r\nYou compete for the highest scores by being fast and controlled, compare your skills to other racers and challenge them on different tracks of bike game. Watch the leaderboard and stay on top by beating others' scores.\r\n\r\nGLOBAL RANKING - THE BEST RACERS COMPETE\r\n\r\nA global bike racing game contest that all riders dream of! Race against players around the world in modes based on the actual Championship. Experience super realism in the palm of your hand, release your bike racing game instincts, and break the limits of speed! Your skill and commitment will be recognized on the global leaderboards. You can customize your own bike and challenge your friends with the highest scores.\r\n\r\nBIKE RACING GAME MAIN FEATURE\r\n\r\nExperience the motorcycle racing game with unparalleled graphics:\r\n- Real 3D graphics & various camera angles\r\n- Real motorcycle racing control: smooth physics and handling\r\n- Detailed and exquisitely reproduced super sports motorcycle\r\n- Realistic and vibrant racers movements\r\n- Diversity bike racing game and motorcycle customizing\r\n- Photorealistic bike and rider models\r\n- Customizable bike game, gear, and outfits\r\n- Leaderboards and achievements of motorcycle racers\r\n\r\nPedal to the Medal - Race to the Podium in this High-Speed Motorcycle Racing Game - Experience the most thrilling bike racing game on mobile.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Ride Hard, Race Harder!<br>Start the engine, hit the gas and experience the thrill of handling a 200 HP beast with Moto Racing Bike Game. <br><br>REAL MOTO RACING EXPERIENCE<br><br>A motorcycle racing game that keeps you on the track, focuses on bike racing skills and experiences the intense bike racing action.<br>You compete for the highest scores by being fast and controlled, compare your skills to other racers and challenge them on different tracks of bike game. Watch the leaderboard and stay on top by beating others&#39; scores.<br><br>GLOBAL RANKING - THE BEST RACERS COMPETE<br><br>A global bike racing game contest that all riders dream of! Race against players around the world in modes based on the actual Championship. Experience super realism in the palm of your hand, release your bike racing game instincts, and break the limits of speed! Your skill and commitment will be recognized on the global leaderboards. You can customize your own bike and challenge your friends with the highest scores.<br><br>BIKE RACING GAME MAIN FEATURE<br><br>Experience the motorcycle racing game with unparalleled graphics:<br>- Real 3D graphics &amp; various camera angles<br>- Real motorcycle racing control: smooth physics and handling<br>- Detailed and exquisitely reproduced super sports motorcycle<br>- Realistic and vibrant racers movements<br>- Diversity bike racing game and motorcycle customizing<br>- Photorealistic bike and rider models<br>- Customizable bike game, gear, and outfits<br>- Leaderboards and achievements of motorcycle racers<br><br>Pedal to the Medal - Race to the Podium in this High-Speed Motorcycle Racing Game - Experience the most thrilling bike racing game on mobile.",
